{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XoaSeyBeV59M4aZYc7jdPF","type":"tool_result","content":"diff --git a/.pose/indexes/validation-matrix.json b/.pose/indexes/validation-matrix.json\nindex c18214df..c239ca87 100644\n--- a/.pose/indexes/validation-matrix.json\n+++ b/.pose/indexes/validation-matrix.json\n@@ -2596,6 +2596,20 @@\n           \"severity\": \"required\",\n           \"evidenceClass\": \"integration\"\n         },\n+        {\n+          \"name\": \"help-lists-every-command-integration\",\n+          \"program\": \"go\",\n+          \"args\": [\n+            \"test\",\n+            \"-race\",\n+            \"./internal/cli\",\n+            \"-run\",\n+            \"TestPoseHelp|TestTheManualsDocumentEveryCommand|TestTheHelpReaderIgnores\",\n+            \"-count=1\"\n+          ],\n+          \"severity\": \"required\",\n+          \"evidenceClass\": \"integration\"\n+        },\n         {\n           \"name\": \"review-brief-conclusion-rules-integration\",\n           \"program\": \"go\",\n@@ -2635,7 +2649,7 @@\n             \"./internal/cli\",\n             \"./internal/mcpserver\",\n             \"-run\",\n-            \"InProcessRun|CloseoutHandoff|AHandoff|NoHandoff|PendingJudgment|InProcessWrapper|EveryMCPRoute|OnlyAdmitted|ReadOnlyWrappers|KeepTheProcessBoundary|TypedHandoff|StableAndADone|TheMCPPlanIsTheDomainPlan|AdmittedWritesAreExactly|Golden|BlockedOrUnstable|SelectedTarget|TheDigestOfAHandoff|ACancelledCaller|ACompletionThat|AbandonedRuns|NotTakenWhenTheSpawn|APanicInAnInProcess\",\n+            \"InProcessRun|CloseoutHandoff|AHandoff|NoHandoff|PendingJudgment|InProcessWrapper|EveryMCPRoute|OnlyAdmitted|ReadOnlyWrappers|KeepTheProcessBoundary|TypedHandoff|StableAndADone|TheMCPPlanIsTheDomainPlan|AdmittedWritesAreExactly|Golden|BlockedOrUnstable|TheDigestOfAHandoff|ACancelledCaller|ACompletionThat|AbandonedRuns|NotTakenWhenTheSpawn|APanicInAnInProcess|APendingMechanicalStep|TheHandoffKeepsTheSelectedProject